OL,3,GNEWSAWooden 194-year-old lighthouse in
OL,4,Aneed of repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs to a nearly two-centuries-old
OL,7,Fwooden lighthouse on the Somerset
OL,8,Fcoastline will take place in the next
OL,9,Ffew months to help "future proof" it.
OL,11,FThe Burnham-on-Sea Low Lighthouse has
OL,12,Fhelped guide ships and vessels since it
OL,13,Fwas originally built in 1832 and
OL,14,Fremains a fully operational
OL,15,Fnavigational aid.
OL,17,FRepairs needed include rusting
OL,18,Fmetalwork, damage to one of the legs
OL,19,Fand paint peeling away from the Grade
OL,20,FII-listed structure, as first reported
OL,21,Fby Burnham-on-Sea.com.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
