OL,3,GNEWSAWooden 194-year-old lighthouse in
OL,4,Aneed of repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FSomerset Council said: "We're
OL,7,Fdeveloping plans and seeking funding to
OL,8,Frepair and repaint it. The work will be
OL,9,Fcarried out when weather and operating
OL,10,Fconditions are suitable, helping to
OL,11,Fprotect the lighthouse."
